{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bring the glass to the customer!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As two construction workers, you are transporting a glass window for a skyscraper. On this journey you have to be careful with the glass because it is very fragile. Can you make it to the top of the skyscraper without breaking it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/carry_the_glass_map.gif?t=1748026397\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer: Get help from a friend to carry the glass!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite a trusted friend to your lobby to carry the glass with you!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/carry_the_glass_coop.gif?t=1748026397\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Characters with physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've added physics to every part of the characters to improve the gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/carry_the_glass_player_hit.gif?t=1748026397\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes: Easy, Hard (no checkpoints)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want a more casual experience, you should try easy mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But if you believe you can make it to the top without breaking the glass, then hard mode might be for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/carry_the_glass_wishlist.png?t=1748026397\" /></div></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Break The Glass 50 Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3263320/ae3006bd42e2260421fd9b4e108dbd031aec9cf7.jpg"},{"name":"Break The Glass 200 Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3263320/b4e5a663bde4074d97459f0a5c04eb1e9fbaf124.jpg"},{"name":"Break The Glass 500 Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3263320/74015f67eacd944bcb70b1b72c13d4a694eaff26.jpg"},{"name":"First Timer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3263320/3943b8a301eddec50eb46f2beb5b4ead2afbece6.jpg"},{"name":"Put The Glass Where It Belongs","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3263320/71e6e38f10a0a13c01423113f56f23ba4832d8d8.jpg"},{"name":"Immportal Buddy Skyscraper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3263320/93c872afdf6432a3e0a558c0478d16773a7170cc.jpg"},{"name":"You Get Used To It","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3263320/86486d32d06a7f37a985e2ea8a1cd11056fb2f3f.jpg"},{"name":"Still A Kid","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3263320/5acb46ce5352d4b00e99a35de19917f825cc3c11.jpg"},{"name":"Easter Bunny Skyscraper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3263320/7b1519618dbe35a009f97e04dec2089573ff60b1.jpg"},{"name":"No Pirates, Thx.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3263320/837221e47f1bf14be89c450020f740d89f468bf8.jpg"}],"total":19},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3263320?t=1748026397","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3263320?t=1748026397","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/6f0421f1921022babba485fab04dd0b458f511af/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748026397","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/6f0421f1921022babba485fab04dd0b458f511af/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748026397","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bring the glass to the customer!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As two construction workers, you are transporting a glass window for a skyscraper. On this journey you have to be careful with the glass because it is very fragile. Can you make it to the top of the skyscraper without breaking it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/carry_the_glass_map.gif?t=1748026397\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Multiplayer: Get help from a friend to carry the glass!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Invite a trusted friend to your lobby to carry the glass with you!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/carry_the_glass_coop.gif?t=1748026397\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Characters with physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">We've added physics to every part of the characters to improve the gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/carry_the_glass_player_hit.gif?t=1748026397\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes: Easy, Hard (no checkpoints)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you want a more casual experience, you should try easy mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But if you believe you can make it to the top without breaking the glass, then hard mode might be for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/carry_the_glass_wishlist.png?t=1748026397\" /></div></p>","developers":["\u00c7a\u011fatay Demir","Enes Kaplan"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/header.jpg?t=1748026397","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257060557,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060557/movie480.mp4?t=1728539264","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060557/movie_max.mp4?t=1728539264"},"name":"Carry The Glass - Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257060557/cfed89374edad87b115361da2489ef944230a398/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1728539264","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060557/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1728539264","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257060557/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1728539264"}}],"name":"Carry The Glass","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Glass Carriers - $4.99 USD","packageid":1156385,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":499}],"title"